| ButtBoff5: This version works for not just a single buffer, but an entire buff bot team
| This will use EQBC server and NetBot to allow your entire bot team to interact with chat, tell, hail requests
|
| /hail <any-buff-bot>: This is equivalent to "/say "buff", which each member in the NetBot team will evaluate.
|	In the .INI file, you will see "buff" is the generic request for all common buffs. Where as asking for a teleport
|   or a corpse summon is a very specific request.
|
| /say <alt-ability>: Each member in the NetBot team will evaluate. If they have this ability in the .Ini config file, they will use this AA.
|    examples: 
|		/say invis  == enchanter bot will invis and invis to undeead you.
|		/say summon == necro bot will summon your corpse
|
| /say <item>: Each member in the NetBot team will evaluate. Items and Alt Abilities are processed the same way.
|	examples:
|		/say wep 	== mage bot will give you pet weapons
| 		/say mask	== mage bot will give you pet mask
|		/say armor	== mage bot will give you pet armor
|		/say heirloom	== mage bot will give you pet heirlooms
|		/say toys	== mage bot will give you all pet toys
|
| /say item <count>: If you put an integer after the item name, the bot will give you multiple items. This is capped at 4.
|	example:
|		/say toys 2 == mage bot will give you two sets of pet toys
|
| /say vs /tell -- both should work equivalently, if you want to be less obvious about getting a buff, use /tell.
| 
| -------------------------------------------------------
| Required Plugins: MQ2DanNet, MQ2Cast, MQ2SQLite
| MQ2 version: mqnext. Other versions should work; untested.

| /plugin MQ2DanNet
| /plugin MQ2Cast
| /plugin MQ2SQLite

| color codes: https://docs.macroquest.org/macroquest/commands/slash-commands/echo
| -------------------------------------------------------
|
| Forked from:
|
| BuffBot2 by MacQ
| 1.0 - 2/25/2021		Initial Release
| 1.3 - 3/14/2021 	New logic to handle low level spells
| 									New [CLASS] INI variables per spell for Min/Max Target Level
| 									Numerous logic changes and bug fixes
| 									Embedded casting routine (formerly MQ2Cast2.inc)
| 									Modified/Added some [General] INI variables
| 1.4 - 6/21/2021		Increased main loop delay from 10 to 20
| 									Added /autoinventory to main loop
| 									Moved AcceptedItems to General INI category
| 									Fixed bug related to reagent name not being properly communicated
| 									Eliminated manditory use of Spell ID, can now use Spell ID or Spell Name
| 1.5 - 8/24/2021		Added two new variables in individual Spell info .ini.  One variable for
| 									spells that requrie a group (i.e., Necro corpse summon) or one variable for
| 									spells that require targeting a corpse (i.e., Cleric rez). Added ability to
| 									message targeted receipient if spell recast time is longer than a definable time.
| 
